ഒന്നാം ഘട്ടത്തിലെ പരിശോധന.

Hamlet, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Juliet, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Romeo, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Othello, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Macbeth, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Lady Macbeth, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Ophelia, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Cordelia, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Portia, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Viola, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Prospero, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.

Act I: കണക്കിന്റെ പ്രധാന ഘട്ടം.

Scene I: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Prospero and Hamlet]
Prospero:
 Listen to your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Juliet]
Prospero:
 Listen to your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Romeo]
Prospero:
 Listen to your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Othello]
Prospero:
 Listen to your heart.
[Exeunt]

Scene II: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Portia and Viola]
Viola:
 You are a hero.
Portia:
 You are as good as the difference between a big big big big big big big hero and a hero.

Scene III: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
Portia:
 Are you better than nothing?
Viola:
 If not, let us proceed to scene IV.
 You are as good as the product of yourself and a big hero.
Portia:
 You are as good as the difference between yourself and a hero.
 Let us return to scene III.

Scene IV: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
Viola:
 You are as good as the difference between yourself and a hero.
[Exeunt]

Scene V: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Portia and Macbeth]
Portia:
 You are as good as the sum of Hamlet and Othello.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a big big big big big big big hero.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a big big big big big hero.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a big big big big hero.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a big big hero.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a hero.
 You are as good as the product of yourself and yourself.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the product of a big big big big big big big hero and Juliet.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the product of a big big big big big hero and Juliet.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the product of a big big big big hero and Juliet.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the product of a big hero and Juliet.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and Juliet.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and Othello.
 You are as good as the difference between yourself and a hero.
 You are as good as the remainder of the quotient between yourself and Portia.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a hero.
[Exeunt]

Scene VI: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Portia and Lady Macbeth]
Portia:
 You are as good as the sum of Macbeth and Othello.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a big big big big big big big hero.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a big big big big big big hero.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a big hero.
 You are as good as the product of yourself and yourself.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the product of a big big big big big big big hero and Macbeth.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the product of a big big big big big big hero and Macbeth.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and Macbeth.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the product of a big big big big big big big hero and Romeo.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the product of a big big big big big big hero and Romeo.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the product of a big big hero and Romeo.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and Romeo.
 You are as good as the difference between yourself and a hero.
 You are as good as the remainder of the quotient between yourself and Portia.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a hero.
[Exeunt]

Scene VII: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Lady Macbeth and Ophelia]
Lady Macbeth:
 You are as good as the remainder of the quotient between Lady Macbeth and a big hero.
Ophelia:
 Am I as good as a hero?
Lady Macbeth:
 If so, let us proceed to scene VIII.
 Let us proceed to scene IX.
[Exeunt]

Scene VIII: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Cordelia]
Prospero:
 You are a hero.
 Let us proceed to scene X.
[Exeunt]

Scene IX: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Cordelia]
Prospero:
 You are as good as the difference between nothing and a hero.
[Exeunt]

Scene X: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Macbeth]
Prospero:
 Open your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Cordelia]
Prospero:
 Open your heart.
[Exeunt]
